WEBVTT

01:21.350 --> 01:26.830
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.630 --> 01:29.750
[Episode 25]

01:35.070 --> 01:35.759
My Lady,

01:36.070 --> 01:39.490
did Third Master Chen come there
to ask for your hand in marriage?

01:39.490 --> 01:40.590
He said

01:40.590 --> 01:42.120
he came back from Tongzhou.

01:42.759 --> 01:45.430
Then he must've asked Old Madam Ji
for permission to marry you!

01:45.430 --> 01:46.680
Did she agree?

01:50.509 --> 01:51.570
That's wonderful!

01:53.789 --> 01:55.050
I didn't expect you...

01:55.920 --> 01:57.720
to actually be getting married.

01:59.690 --> 02:01.460
It all feels like a dream to me.

02:02.350 --> 02:03.200
Me too.

02:05.800 --> 02:07.510
I don't know, but something feels off,

02:07.510 --> 02:09.169
and I can't really explain it.

02:12.190 --> 02:13.240
Right now, I still have

02:13.240 --> 02:14.710
a tricky matter to handle.

02:16.740 --> 02:25.710
[Marquis Changxing's Mansion]

02:17.310 --> 02:18.520
Okay, I got it.

02:19.000 --> 02:19.600
Thank you.

02:26.240 --> 02:26.800
My Lady.

02:30.710 --> 02:31.400
How was it?

02:31.960 --> 02:32.710
The gatekeeper said

02:32.710 --> 02:33.630
Young Lord Ye has been on duty

02:33.630 --> 02:34.840
in the palace these days

02:34.840 --> 02:36.770
and won't be out for a few more days.

02:37.800 --> 02:39.520
Of all the times to be on duty...

02:39.520 --> 02:41.590
But Guard Li came back once

02:42.000 --> 02:44.400
to collect a change of clothes
for His Lordship.

02:44.400 --> 02:44.870
My Lady,

02:45.520 --> 02:47.120
why don't you write a letter?

02:47.300 --> 02:49.230
I'll find a way to pass it to Guard Li

02:49.630 --> 02:51.890
so he can deliver it to His Lordship.

02:53.030 --> 02:53.680
No.

02:54.240 --> 02:55.150
I must

02:55.560 --> 02:57.090
tell him myself about this.

02:57.310 --> 02:59.510
Otherwise, it would be disrespectful.

03:02.310 --> 03:03.310
It's all my fault.

03:03.680 --> 03:05.340
I should've told him earlier.

03:07.670 --> 03:08.200
Lie down.

03:10.430 --> 03:10.800
Here.

03:15.080 --> 03:15.690
Ye Xian,

03:15.800 --> 03:17.000
you always have a way.

03:17.430 --> 03:18.590
Since you've been here
these past few days,

03:18.590 --> 03:19.360
Shuanghua is

03:19.360 --> 03:20.630
getting better day by day.

03:20.630 --> 03:21.430
She's eating and sleeping well,

03:21.430 --> 03:22.800
and can even run and jump again.

03:22.800 --> 03:23.360
I think

03:23.630 --> 03:25.030
she's simply fond of you.

03:25.430 --> 03:26.910
Your Majesty flatters me.

03:27.079 --> 03:28.020
As I see it,

03:28.120 --> 03:29.850
she hasn't taken a liking to me.

03:30.190 --> 03:30.870
She's taken a liking

03:30.870 --> 03:31.840
to the jerky I brought in

03:31.840 --> 03:33.240
from outside the palace.

03:36.240 --> 03:37.370
Come on, Shuanghua.

03:40.430 --> 03:42.680
Looks like she's grown tired of
palace food

03:42.680 --> 03:44.150
and is craving something new.

03:44.150 --> 03:45.410
Even a dog is like this,

03:45.430 --> 03:46.430
let alone people.

03:48.280 --> 03:49.310
Speaking of this,

03:49.560 --> 03:50.310
it reminds me of

03:50.310 --> 03:51.710
something rather strange.

03:51.710 --> 03:53.630
The other day, my throat was itchy,

03:53.630 --> 03:55.000
and I wanted some pear soup.

03:55.000 --> 03:56.310
But after giving the order,

03:56.310 --> 03:57.310
I had to wait an hour

03:57.310 --> 03:58.030
for it.

03:58.800 --> 03:59.660
Yesterday,

03:59.840 --> 04:01.500
Mr. Fu came to give me a lecture

04:01.680 --> 04:03.030
and also wanted pear soup.

04:03.030 --> 04:04.020
Yet it was served

04:04.120 --> 04:05.310
almost immediately

04:05.400 --> 04:07.150
and even at just the right temperature.

04:07.150 --> 04:08.710
I found it rather strange,

04:09.400 --> 04:11.400
so I ordered someone to look into it.

04:11.870 --> 04:12.760
Guess what?

04:13.560 --> 04:15.000
Turns out that the Huangji Palace's

04:15.000 --> 04:16.720
small kitchen has been preparing

04:16.720 --> 04:17.800
pear soup and lamb broth

04:17.800 --> 04:19.130
for him all along.

04:21.510 --> 04:23.000
That is indeed strange.

04:26.920 --> 04:27.980
Speaking of which,

04:28.120 --> 04:29.590
I've also encountered

04:29.680 --> 04:32.010
something strange over the past few days.

04:32.240 --> 04:32.920
Go on, then.

04:33.940 --> 04:35.920
Does Your Majesty know
that the Penal Court

04:35.920 --> 04:37.120
has a file storeroom?

04:38.240 --> 04:40.100
The late Emperor told me about it.

04:40.190 --> 04:41.360
The Penal Court

04:41.360 --> 04:42.920
keeps all its oversight records

04:42.920 --> 04:44.080
on court officials there.

04:44.080 --> 04:44.760
Yes,

04:45.040 --> 04:46.950
the records for every official are there—

04:46.950 --> 04:47.950
except for

04:47.950 --> 04:49.409
one particular person's.

04:50.950 --> 04:52.210
Your Majesty, tell me,

04:52.270 --> 04:53.400
isn't that strange?

04:56.510 --> 04:57.390
Strange.

04:58.120 --> 05:00.000
Yours is even stranger.

05:02.070 --> 05:03.400
Jiuheng, rest assured.

05:03.430 --> 05:05.360
Leave this matter to my wife and me.

05:06.190 --> 05:06.680
Okay.

05:07.190 --> 05:08.240
Then I will leave it to

05:08.240 --> 05:09.770
you and your wife, Zhonglu.

05:11.390 --> 05:12.940
I really envy you, Jiuheng.

05:13.160 --> 05:14.460
You're so carefree,

05:14.560 --> 05:16.510
and yet another great blessing in life
is coming your way.

05:16.510 --> 05:17.190
Unlike me—

05:17.310 --> 05:18.310
ever since Grand Secretary Fan Chuan

05:18.310 --> 05:19.680
left the Hall of Literary Profundity,

05:19.680 --> 05:20.950
and now with you gone as well,

05:20.950 --> 05:22.520
I've been run off my feet.

05:22.720 --> 05:23.830
You have no idea.

05:23.830 --> 05:25.560
The memorials are stacked so high now.

05:25.560 --> 05:27.160
Just today, I was urging
the Senior Grand Secretary

05:27.160 --> 05:29.120
to bring you back as soon as possible.

05:29.120 --> 05:29.830
Oh, you.

05:32.070 --> 05:35.370
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

05:32.720 --> 05:34.310
I can see that all you officials

05:34.310 --> 05:35.800
of the court have served diligently,

05:35.800 --> 05:37.430
each fulfilling your own duties,

05:37.430 --> 05:38.870
loyal to the nation,

05:39.040 --> 05:40.630
and exhausting your minds and efforts.

05:40.630 --> 05:41.870
I am very pleased.

05:42.390 --> 05:44.600
Therefore, in consideration
of your tireless efforts,

05:44.600 --> 05:47.800
I hereby abolish the post of
Inspector of the Penal Court.

05:48.510 --> 05:50.880
Let us henceforth be united in purpose,

05:51.040 --> 05:52.830
working together on affairs of state

05:52.830 --> 05:56.090
to secure peace for the people
and stability for the realm.

06:02.480 --> 06:04.390
Your Majesty is wise!

06:04.390 --> 06:09.120
Long live the Emperor!

06:08.300 --> 06:12.740
[The Emperor Establishes Supreme Order]

06:12.860 --> 06:15.900
[Gu]

06:18.430 --> 06:18.950
My Lady.

06:21.800 --> 06:22.530
How did it go?

06:22.680 --> 06:24.080
Did you manage to see him?

06:25.070 --> 06:26.390
A fire broke out at the Penal Court,

06:26.390 --> 06:27.750
burning much of it to the ground.

06:27.750 --> 06:30.010
Young Lord Ye is so busy
he can't get away.

06:35.390 --> 06:37.270
I heard my husband say

06:37.270 --> 06:38.930
that after the court session,

06:39.000 --> 06:41.950
the Senior Grand Secretary's face
was black with fury.

06:41.950 --> 06:42.800
It seems

06:42.800 --> 06:43.510
even the Senior Grand Secretary

06:43.510 --> 06:45.950
had no prior knowledge
of His Majesty's intention

06:45.950 --> 06:48.810
to abolish the post of
Inspector of the Penal Court.

06:51.159 --> 06:51.920
Old Madam,

06:52.630 --> 06:53.430
Second Madam,

06:53.720 --> 06:54.980
Madam Yao has arrived.

06:56.950 --> 06:58.630
She wasn't expected until noon.

06:58.630 --> 06:59.680
She's early.

07:01.040 --> 07:01.870
She must be

07:02.190 --> 07:03.630
eager to move forward with

07:03.630 --> 07:05.360
Lian and Yao Wenxiu's wedding.

07:06.650 --> 07:07.910
You should hurry over.

07:11.510 --> 07:13.040
Mother, please come along.

07:13.160 --> 07:14.510
For such an important matter,

07:14.510 --> 07:16.710
we need you there to make the decisions.

07:16.950 --> 07:17.750
That's true.

07:31.120 --> 07:32.260
Xiuju? Xiuju.

07:34.920 --> 07:36.240
Go listen in over there.

07:36.240 --> 07:37.000
If anything happens,

07:37.000 --> 07:38.260
hurry back and tell me.

07:38.430 --> 07:39.390
Yes, My Lady.

07:55.310 --> 07:56.830
What should I do?

07:57.070 --> 07:58.730
Madam Yao is likely here today

07:59.000 --> 07:59.680
to set the date

07:59.680 --> 08:00.950
for my wedding

08:00.950 --> 08:01.870
to Wenxiu.

08:14.160 --> 08:14.920
We're late,

08:15.240 --> 08:15.950
Madam Yao.

08:16.070 --> 08:17.560
-Old Madam Gu.
-Sorry to keep you waiting.

08:17.560 --> 08:18.520
Not at all.

08:18.630 --> 08:20.000
I was early.

08:20.870 --> 08:22.530
Please take the seat of honor.

08:26.160 --> 08:27.040
I came today

08:27.310 --> 08:28.510
for Wenxiu and Lian's

08:28.510 --> 08:30.240
engagement.

08:33.270 --> 08:34.240
Right.

08:34.840 --> 08:36.870
After the new year, Wenxiu will be 18

08:37.030 --> 08:38.530
and Lian 17.

08:38.630 --> 08:40.039
It's time to set a date.

08:41.080 --> 08:43.809
Have you found someone
to pick an auspicious day?

08:45.840 --> 08:46.440
What?

08:47.240 --> 08:48.700
Is there something wrong?

08:57.500 --> 09:00.250
Do you think it's better to have it

09:00.550 --> 09:02.550
at the end of the year or next spring?

09:03.780 --> 09:06.310
I'd prefer next spring.

09:06.670 --> 09:08.800
After all, the weather will be warmer,

09:08.840 --> 09:11.240
and the wedding attire will look lovelier.

09:16.320 --> 09:17.910
I've heard that life as a new bride

09:17.910 --> 09:19.380
can be quite difficult.

09:19.790 --> 09:21.200
You two are lucky—

09:21.390 --> 09:23.120
you don't have to worry about such things.

09:23.120 --> 09:24.120
After all,

09:24.360 --> 09:26.020
one has too poor a reputation,

09:26.150 --> 09:26.890
and the other's

09:26.890 --> 09:28.350
birth mother misbehaved—

09:28.750 --> 09:30.680
neither of you is easy to marry off.

09:33.720 --> 09:35.240
Are you stupid or what?

09:37.270 --> 09:38.280
What did you say?

09:38.750 --> 09:39.840
Are you genuinely ignorant,

09:39.840 --> 09:41.170
or are you playing dumb?

09:41.320 --> 09:43.960
Although Lord Yao is
the Vice Minister of Justice,

09:43.960 --> 09:45.550
he has four sons.

09:45.960 --> 09:46.970
And Yao Wenxiu

09:47.080 --> 09:48.120
is the youngest.

09:48.790 --> 09:49.790
By the time their family's assets

09:49.790 --> 09:50.960
are divided down to him,

09:50.960 --> 09:53.270
there'll probably be next to nothing left.

09:53.270 --> 09:54.750
And he has no particular talent either—

09:54.750 --> 09:56.670
to this day, he is only a xiucai.

09:56.840 --> 09:58.320
If he still fails to enter officialdom
in the future

09:58.320 --> 09:59.840
and his family provides no subsidy,

09:59.840 --> 10:00.720
once you marry him,

10:00.720 --> 10:01.910
he will depend

10:02.150 --> 10:03.950
entirely on your dowry to get by.

10:04.750 --> 10:05.600
If I were you,

10:05.840 --> 10:07.000
I'd be worried sick.

10:07.270 --> 10:09.530
How are you still able to look so pleased?

10:09.680 --> 10:10.780
Gu Jinzhao, you...

10:13.910 --> 10:15.440
Don't think that just because you have
a bit of money

10:15.440 --> 10:17.170
you can flaunt it in front of me.

10:17.390 --> 10:18.320
I'm telling you,

10:18.720 --> 10:20.200
once I marry Wenxiu,

10:20.320 --> 10:21.390
I will make sure every one of your shops

10:21.390 --> 10:22.850
is driven into the ground!

10:26.360 --> 10:27.670
You dare laugh at me?

10:28.240 --> 10:29.320
I didn't.

10:29.910 --> 10:31.640
How would I dare to laugh at you?

10:31.720 --> 10:33.670
I... I envy you, if anything.

10:39.750 --> 10:41.480
Why are you acting so weird?

10:42.000 --> 10:43.790
Are you up to something?

10:44.960 --> 10:45.670
My Lady!

10:48.080 --> 10:48.750
My Lady!

10:52.080 --> 10:52.990
How did it go?

10:53.150 --> 10:55.200
Did they decide on the end of the year
or next spring?

10:55.200 --> 10:56.000
Neither.

10:56.550 --> 10:57.600
Madam Yao said...

10:58.630 --> 11:01.290
She said she wants to
break off your engagement.

11:02.870 --> 11:04.330
Break off the engagement?

11:06.670 --> 11:07.550
Why?

11:07.670 --> 11:08.600
I don't know.

11:09.440 --> 11:11.360
Are you an idiot? How could you not know?

11:11.360 --> 11:12.720
The moment I heard them mention
breaking off the engagement,

11:12.720 --> 11:14.000
I hurried back.

11:14.200 --> 11:16.130
I didn't hear anything after that.

11:17.320 --> 11:18.000
No.

11:18.750 --> 11:20.480
I need to go over there and ask why.

11:20.480 --> 11:21.680
My Lady, you can't go!

11:23.300 --> 11:24.560
Why can't I go?

11:24.600 --> 11:25.960
They're talking about
breaking off your engagement.

11:25.960 --> 11:26.690
If you go now,

11:26.720 --> 11:28.450
how humiliating would that be?

11:41.720 --> 11:42.840
Was it you?

11:43.720 --> 11:44.600
I know it.

11:45.000 --> 11:46.200
It had to be you.

11:47.180 --> 11:48.120
Because only you

11:48.120 --> 11:49.920
would be capable of such tricks.

11:50.440 --> 11:52.130
You hate me,

11:52.160 --> 11:53.680
so you came up with some schemes

11:53.680 --> 11:55.320
to make the Yao family
break off the engagement with me!

11:55.320 --> 11:56.910
Tell me, wasn't that it?

11:57.080 --> 11:58.460
If the Yao family calls off
the engagement with you,

11:58.460 --> 11:59.200
it'll bring shame

11:59.200 --> 12:00.600
to our entire household!

12:00.750 --> 12:02.210
What good would that do me?

12:02.850 --> 12:03.970
Unbelievable.

12:04.360 --> 12:05.390
Lan, let's go.

12:05.440 --> 12:06.970
You're not going anywhere!

12:08.270 --> 12:09.990
Even if it wasn't because of you directly,

12:09.990 --> 12:11.730
it was still your fourth branch—

12:11.730 --> 12:13.510
you got my father thrown in prison

12:13.510 --> 12:14.800
and his reputation ruined—

12:14.800 --> 12:17.130
that's why the Yao family is withdrawing!

12:17.940 --> 12:19.190
I knew it.

12:19.960 --> 12:21.440
Ever since you lot moved back,

12:21.440 --> 12:22.960
this household
has had nothing but bad luck!

12:22.960 --> 12:24.270
Nothing but bad luck!

12:25.000 --> 12:25.880
You...

12:26.240 --> 12:27.960
You're nothing but a bunch of jinxes!

12:27.960 --> 12:29.360
Bringers of misfortune!

12:30.270 --> 12:31.550
If the Yao family
truly breaks off your engagement

12:31.550 --> 12:32.810
for a reason like that,

12:32.910 --> 12:34.080
then not marrying into

12:34.080 --> 12:34.870
such a snobbish family

12:34.870 --> 12:36.930
might actually be a blessing for you!

12:38.000 --> 12:39.080
Oh, a blessing

12:39.080 --> 12:40.080
for you!

12:40.670 --> 12:42.320
You can't get yourself married off,

12:42.320 --> 12:44.920
yet you're jealous
that I've made a good match!

12:47.000 --> 12:48.360
Maybe it's simply that Yao Wenxiu

12:48.360 --> 12:49.240
never liked you

12:49.550 --> 12:51.910
and has been
looking for a way out all along.

12:51.910 --> 12:53.390
Nonsense!

12:53.390 --> 12:55.090
I'll rip your mouth apart!

12:56.080 --> 12:56.750
Zhao!

12:59.750 --> 13:02.010
I'd like to see who dares bully my sister!

13:03.750 --> 13:04.390
In any case,

13:04.390 --> 13:06.670
our Yao family has wronged yours.

13:07.030 --> 13:08.200
As for the betrothal gifts,

13:08.200 --> 13:09.030
we have no intention

13:09.030 --> 13:10.160
of taking them back.

13:10.320 --> 13:12.250
Just consider them compensation.

13:13.030 --> 13:14.320
But no matter what,

13:14.670 --> 13:15.910
this marriage

13:16.240 --> 13:17.600
must be called off.

13:19.320 --> 13:20.870
Old Madam, Second Madam,

13:20.520 --> 13:23.200
[Embrace Simplicity
and Maintain Innocence]

13:20.960 --> 13:22.030
trouble! Trouble!

13:24.510 --> 13:25.970
Second Miss, Eldest Miss,

13:26.000 --> 13:26.720
Third Miss,

13:26.790 --> 13:28.510
and Young Master Rong
have all broken out into a fight!

13:28.510 --> 13:30.150
Second Miss hit Third Miss,

13:30.150 --> 13:31.550
and Young Master Rong...

13:31.630 --> 13:32.490
Useless thing!

13:33.000 --> 13:33.550
Get out!

13:34.030 --> 13:35.360
You ill-mannered brat!

13:38.670 --> 13:40.620
Lian even hits people now?

13:40.750 --> 13:42.030
With such a temper,

13:42.050 --> 13:44.250
who could possibly endure serving her?

13:45.550 --> 13:46.510
Well.

13:47.550 --> 13:49.440
I've made my intentions clear today.

13:49.440 --> 13:52.590
I trust you will come to a decision soon.

13:52.840 --> 13:54.150
Don't drag it out.

13:56.510 --> 13:57.910
Old Madam, Second Madam!

13:58.000 --> 13:59.000
Hurry! Hurry!

13:59.200 --> 13:59.930
Outrageous!

14:00.000 --> 14:02.060
Every single one of you, outrageous!

14:04.470 --> 14:06.870
Old Madam, Second Madam, please calm down.

14:07.320 --> 14:09.270
It is not that this servant intentionally
broke the rules.

14:09.270 --> 14:10.270
It's just that...

14:10.720 --> 14:11.510
Madam He

14:11.720 --> 14:13.520
has already arrived at the gate.

14:14.400 --> 14:15.270
Madam He?

14:15.630 --> 14:16.600
Which Madam He?

14:17.000 --> 14:17.750
The wife of

14:18.120 --> 14:19.120
He Wenxin,

14:19.360 --> 14:21.000
Grand Secretary He.

14:21.150 --> 14:22.880
Madam He is here?

14:25.360 --> 14:26.160
Oh?

14:26.200 --> 14:27.810
Does Madam He also associate

14:27.840 --> 14:29.120
with your family?

14:29.270 --> 14:30.150
Hurry, hurry.

14:30.150 --> 14:31.390
Open the main gates to receive her!

14:31.390 --> 14:32.000
Yes.

14:35.390 --> 14:36.670
We're too busy today,

14:36.750 --> 14:37.720
so we won't keep you any longer.

14:37.720 --> 14:38.910
Cuilyu, see our guest out.

14:38.910 --> 14:39.550
True.

14:39.550 --> 14:41.030
Receiving your distinguished guest
is more important.

14:41.030 --> 14:42.240
As for canceling the engagement,

14:42.240 --> 14:44.240
I'll go back and discuss it further!

14:44.390 --> 14:46.520
We should take our time to consider it.

15:02.910 --> 15:04.000
My... my stomach

15:04.000 --> 15:05.530
is feeling a little unwell.

15:05.830 --> 15:08.030
Please take me somewhere to freshen up.

15:08.270 --> 15:08.870
Yes.

15:09.150 --> 15:10.550
Please follow me, Madam.

15:20.240 --> 15:22.670
Welcome, Madam He!

15:23.550 --> 15:24.200
This way.

15:26.440 --> 15:27.440
Please, this way.

15:31.770 --> 15:33.910
Properly speaking, I should have sent
a calling card first.

15:33.910 --> 15:34.910
But since our two families

15:34.910 --> 15:36.270
rarely interact,

15:36.510 --> 15:38.000
I worried that sending a card ahead

15:38.000 --> 15:40.270
would only cause you unnecessary trouble.

15:40.270 --> 15:41.240
And I am

15:41.240 --> 15:42.510
an impatient person,

15:42.910 --> 15:44.480
and the person who entrusted me
with the matter

15:44.480 --> 15:45.750
is even more so.

15:46.000 --> 15:46.630
So

15:46.750 --> 15:48.480
I simply came to visit directly.

15:48.480 --> 15:50.740
Please don't take offense, Old Madam Gu.

15:51.630 --> 15:52.670
Not at all.

15:53.270 --> 15:54.550
Your presence in our residence

15:54.550 --> 15:56.080
is a great honor.

15:57.000 --> 15:58.060
Though I wonder...

15:59.030 --> 16:01.360
to what do we owe the visit?

16:02.030 --> 16:04.030
Old Madam Gu, please sit down first.

16:06.750 --> 16:08.550
It's naturally a joyous matter.

16:08.550 --> 16:09.550
Someone has entrusted me

16:09.550 --> 16:12.550
with the task of
proposing a match for your Eldest Miss.

16:12.550 --> 16:13.480
Zhao?

16:15.840 --> 16:17.740
May I ask

16:17.840 --> 16:19.390
who has such great prestige

16:19.840 --> 16:22.080
as to ask you to act as matchmaker?

16:22.720 --> 16:24.080
Who else could it be?

16:24.320 --> 16:25.990
Naturally, it's none other than
the youngest

16:25.990 --> 16:27.630
and most capable official
in the entire country—

16:27.630 --> 16:29.630
Lord Chen Yanyun.

16:34.200 --> 16:34.870
What?

16:35.240 --> 16:37.080
Third Master Chen is proposing to Zhao?

16:37.080 --> 16:37.840
Yes.

16:38.030 --> 16:38.770
Lord Chen

16:38.870 --> 16:40.510
has asked Grand Secretary He's wife

16:40.510 --> 16:41.670
to be the matchmaker.

16:41.670 --> 16:43.080
Old Madam and Second Madam

16:43.080 --> 16:44.150
are receiving her right now.

16:44.150 --> 16:44.750
Old Madam specially

16:44.750 --> 16:45.750
sent me over

16:45.840 --> 16:47.160
to inform you

16:47.320 --> 16:49.150
so that you are aware, My Lady.

16:49.480 --> 16:50.560
Congratulations,

16:50.630 --> 16:51.840
My Lady!

17:01.270 --> 17:02.200
What did you say?

17:02.930 --> 17:05.640
Chen Yanyun is proposing marriage
to Gu Jinzhao?

17:05.640 --> 17:07.069
And he's even asked
the wife of Grand Secretary He

17:07.069 --> 17:08.270
to be the matchmaker?

17:16.310 --> 17:17.550
My Lady, My Lady!

17:18.440 --> 17:19.250
Please don't be angry anymore!

17:19.250 --> 17:20.589
Be careful not to ruin your health!

17:20.589 --> 17:21.920
Don't be angry anymore!

17:23.640 --> 17:24.569
What did you say?

17:26.829 --> 17:29.260
Chen Yanyun wants to marry Eldest Miss Gu?

17:29.400 --> 17:30.980
That Gu Jinzhao?

17:31.200 --> 17:32.440
Did you hear it clearly?

17:32.440 --> 17:33.640
I heard it clearly with my own ears.

17:33.640 --> 17:34.970
Absolutely no mistake.

17:35.960 --> 17:36.900
This is bad.

17:37.470 --> 17:38.370
This is bad.

17:38.590 --> 17:39.050
Well...

17:39.350 --> 17:41.210
How did things turn out like this?

17:42.920 --> 17:44.880
We've handled things badly today.

17:45.440 --> 17:46.790
It seems the Gu family

17:47.000 --> 17:49.130
is not one to be trifled with so easily.

17:49.310 --> 17:50.000
Madam,

17:50.270 --> 17:51.110
but hasn't Lord Chen

17:51.110 --> 17:52.790
already stepped down from his post?

17:52.790 --> 17:53.480
The Master is

17:53.480 --> 17:54.640
the esteemed Vice Minister of Justice.

17:54.640 --> 17:55.680
Do we still need to be wary of him?

17:55.680 --> 17:56.640
What do you know?

17:57.110 --> 17:59.480
Chen Yanyun's so-called "idleness at home"

17:59.480 --> 18:00.400
is merely a way of lying low

18:00.400 --> 18:01.680
until the storm passes.

18:01.680 --> 18:02.790
The moment it passes,

18:02.790 --> 18:04.590
he'll be right back where he was.

18:06.400 --> 18:07.930
He's the true favorite,

18:08.000 --> 18:10.130
valued by the Senior Grand Secretary.

18:10.310 --> 18:12.200
My husband cannot compare to him.

18:14.730 --> 18:22.710
[Eternal Glory]

18:15.240 --> 18:16.510
Take care, Madam He.

18:26.880 --> 18:28.480
I really didn't expect this.

18:29.110 --> 18:30.350
But Chen Yanyun

18:30.910 --> 18:32.910
really had someone come to propose.

18:34.000 --> 18:35.000
Even now,

18:35.000 --> 18:35.920
I still feel the whole matter

18:35.920 --> 18:37.780
doesn't quite seem real somehow.

18:38.000 --> 18:39.030
Look at Zhao—

18:39.590 --> 18:41.070
whether in terms of family background

18:41.070 --> 18:42.830
or her own temperament and disposition,

18:42.830 --> 18:46.090
how does she deserve to marry into
such a prominent family?

18:46.750 --> 18:48.030
At this point,

18:48.350 --> 18:50.550
we have to accept it
even if we aren't pleased.

18:50.550 --> 18:53.070
Old Madam Gu, Second Madam Gu!

18:54.400 --> 18:55.600
You haven't left yet?

18:59.920 --> 19:01.320
Madam Yao, why are you...

19:03.080 --> 19:05.480
Earlier, my stomach felt somewhat unwell,

19:05.550 --> 19:06.750
and I felt a bit dizzy,

19:06.750 --> 19:08.550
so I rested in your mansion for a while.

19:08.550 --> 19:10.110
Knowing you were entertaining the guest,

19:10.110 --> 19:12.310
I didn't have the servants disturb you.

19:13.400 --> 19:14.920
Has Madam He left?

19:16.680 --> 19:17.440
Yes.

19:18.200 --> 19:19.190
Since she's left,

19:19.190 --> 19:21.990
it's time to talk about
our two families' matters!

19:25.350 --> 19:27.070
Just now, I gave it some thought,

19:27.070 --> 19:28.510
and I feel the idea of breaking off

19:28.510 --> 19:30.440
the engagement was indeed rash on my part.

19:30.440 --> 19:31.160
Our two families

19:31.160 --> 19:32.830
have been close for so many years,

19:32.830 --> 19:34.200
and Wenxiu and Lian

19:34.220 --> 19:36.240
have grown up together since childhood.

19:36.240 --> 19:38.440
If we hastily break off the engagement,

19:38.440 --> 19:41.570
wouldn't that be like
tearing apart a pair of lovebirds?

19:42.300 --> 19:43.340
Madam Yao,

19:43.460 --> 19:45.020
listen to yourself.

19:45.240 --> 19:47.920
Our Lian is a young lady of good breeding,

19:48.270 --> 19:50.590
not some wild bird.

19:52.000 --> 19:52.830
Yes, yes.

19:52.880 --> 19:54.470
I misspoke.

19:54.640 --> 19:56.550
But regarding their marriage...

19:57.070 --> 19:58.800
What do you think, Old Madam Gu?

20:02.920 --> 20:03.350
Since

20:03.350 --> 20:05.210
things have been said so plainly,

20:05.350 --> 20:06.640
I will be direct.

20:08.880 --> 20:10.600
Wenxiu and Lian's wedding

20:10.680 --> 20:12.740
has been dragging on for far too long.

20:13.160 --> 20:15.020
If your family is truly sincere,

20:15.310 --> 20:16.880
then show us.

20:18.400 --> 20:20.030
Thank you, Old Madam Gu, my future in-law.

20:20.030 --> 20:22.030
I'll go back and prepare right away.

20:28.590 --> 20:29.270
Mother,

20:29.510 --> 20:31.110
the Yao family has treated us
so despicably.

20:31.110 --> 20:32.340
Are you still willing to let Lian

20:32.340 --> 20:33.780
marry Yao Wenxiu?

20:34.000 --> 20:35.260
What choice do we have?

20:36.510 --> 20:38.100
Say what you will about the Yaos—

20:38.100 --> 20:41.030
they're still an official household
of the 3rd rank.

20:45.640 --> 20:49.000
[Generations of Excellence]

20:58.030 --> 20:58.790
My Lady,

20:58.980 --> 21:01.350
with each autumn rain,
a deeper chill settles in.

21:01.350 --> 21:03.150
Do be careful not to catch a cold.

21:09.720 --> 21:11.000
My Lady, what's wrong?

21:11.830 --> 21:13.030
Third Master Chen's proposal

21:13.030 --> 21:14.350
is such wonderful news.

21:14.350 --> 21:16.000
Why are you sighing?

21:18.440 --> 21:19.400
I don't know.

21:19.790 --> 21:20.640
I knew all along

21:20.640 --> 21:22.770
that he intended to propose marriage.

21:23.070 --> 21:25.000
But now that it's really happened,

21:25.070 --> 21:26.730
it somehow doesn't feel real.

21:31.000 --> 21:31.830
Am I...

21:32.400 --> 21:33.960
really getting married?

21:37.350 --> 21:39.550
Second Madam, Second Miss, greetings.

21:41.860 --> 21:43.120
Why are they here?

21:55.830 --> 21:56.920
Zhao.

22:00.480 --> 22:01.550
Zhao,

22:02.110 --> 22:03.670
congratulations.

22:03.830 --> 22:04.310
You've made

22:04.310 --> 22:05.960
such a good match.

22:06.310 --> 22:07.750
When your second uncle heard the news,

22:07.750 --> 22:08.840
he was overjoyed.

22:09.000 --> 22:09.550
Right now,

22:09.550 --> 22:11.510
he's drinking with your father.

22:18.480 --> 22:19.350
Zhao,

22:20.480 --> 22:23.140
regarding everything
that happened before...

22:24.000 --> 22:27.210
it was because of my narrow-mindedness

22:27.270 --> 22:28.780
and short-sightedness.

22:29.510 --> 22:31.050
I apologize to you here.

22:31.110 --> 22:32.910
I cannot accept such an apology.

22:40.720 --> 22:42.840
And Lian...

22:43.000 --> 22:44.030
I heard she quarreled

22:44.030 --> 22:45.430
with you again today.

22:46.270 --> 22:47.430
Lian

22:47.640 --> 22:49.400
has been spoiled by me since childhood.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.960
She speaks without thinking,

22:50.960 --> 22:53.350
but deep down she regrets it.

22:54.000 --> 22:55.160
Right, Lian?

23:02.830 --> 23:03.890
I apologize to you.

23:05.480 --> 23:07.010
I ask for your forgiveness.

23:09.000 --> 23:10.720
You don't need to apologize to me.

23:10.720 --> 23:11.780
In this household,

23:12.200 --> 23:13.350
you can't bully me.

23:15.070 --> 23:16.000
But Lan

23:16.310 --> 23:18.440
has been bullied by you
time and time again.

23:18.440 --> 23:20.510
She is the one
you should be apologizing to.

23:20.510 --> 23:21.160
You...

23:21.790 --> 23:22.590
Yes, yes.

23:22.750 --> 23:24.270
Lian knows she was wrong.

23:24.400 --> 23:25.270
We were just talking about

23:25.270 --> 23:25.880
going to

23:25.880 --> 23:27.140
Lan's place in a while.

23:27.550 --> 23:28.590
We're going now.

23:29.760 --> 23:30.290
Let's go.

23:33.200 --> 23:33.750
My Lady,

23:34.350 --> 23:35.790
Second Madam certainly

23:35.790 --> 23:37.050
changed her tune fast.

23:42.350 --> 23:44.080
I want to see Third Master Chen.

24:00.070 --> 24:05.690
♪ In the bustling crowd,
every step foreshadows this meeting ♪

24:07.490 --> 24:09.630
♪ Smiling, you remark
that no beautiful scenery in the world ♪

24:10.780 --> 24:14.740
♪ Can match this destined encounter ♪

24:15.460 --> 24:20.850
♪ Time passes quietly,
and this meeting feels like fate ♪

24:22.540 --> 24:24.890
♪ A lifetime spent answering this riddle ♪

24:25.750 --> 24:30.540
♪ If a story's beginning
requires courage ♪

24:26.640 --> 24:28.830
[Glowing Bloom]

24:31.340 --> 24:34.490
♪ I'm willing to take the brush first ♪

24:35.520 --> 24:38.400
♪ With a true heart, paint a scene of us
together through days and nights ♪

24:38.350 --> 24:39.680
If you ever run into trouble again,

24:39.550 --> 24:42.240
♪ I'll always stand here,
quietly guarding ♪

24:40.550 --> 24:42.200
you can blow this whistle.

24:43.030 --> 24:45.850
♪ That very moment
of our first encounter ♪

24:46.620 --> 24:49.380
♪ Whether it is fate or divine will ♪

24:50.630 --> 24:53.140
♪ There is no need to analyze it anymore ♪

24:54.320 --> 24:57.440
♪ When you look back, the wind rises ♪

24:58.360 --> 25:01.530
♪ Gently stirring heartbeats and breaths ♪

25:02.210 --> 25:05.300
♪ Only your palm remains warm as before ♪

25:06.150 --> 25:08.880
♪ Warming my wandering, lonely soul ♪

25:09.240 --> 25:10.340
Will you

25:10.010 --> 25:13.250
♪ Everything exists because of you ♪

25:10.510 --> 25:11.550
marry me?

25:13.980 --> 25:16.970
♪ Every step together brings joy ♪

25:17.630 --> 25:19.750
♪ Day by day, side by side ♪

25:19.510 --> 25:20.790
If I ever

25:21.110 --> 25:22.830
run into trouble at court in the future,

25:21.550 --> 25:24.130
♪ Whether it is fate or divine will ♪

25:23.640 --> 25:24.270
you can take

25:24.270 --> 25:25.580
this letter of amicable separation,

25:25.300 --> 25:27.850
♪ There is no need to analyze it anymore ♪

25:25.750 --> 25:26.680
fill in the date,

25:27.440 --> 25:28.480
and leave whenever you wish

25:28.480 --> 25:29.590
without telling anyone.

25:29.540 --> 25:32.640
♪ When you look back, the wind rises ♪

25:30.440 --> 25:31.550
Or perhaps...

25:32.440 --> 25:33.690
if one day you grow tired of me,

25:33.690 --> 25:36.440
♪ Gently stirring heartbeats and breaths ♪

25:34.440 --> 25:35.900
you may use it then as well.

25:36.930 --> 25:40.910
♪ Year by year, side by side ♪

25:46.000 --> 25:46.790
It's raining.

25:46.790 --> 25:48.520
Why aren't you taking shelter?

25:52.960 --> 25:54.890
Don't you know you'll catch a cold?

26:02.110 --> 26:02.880
Let me check.

26:09.440 --> 26:11.570
Your hands are cold, just as I thought.

26:26.990 --> 26:27.880
What happened?

26:27.910 --> 26:29.840
Why are you in such a hurry to see me?

26:37.270 --> 26:37.920
I...

26:39.360 --> 26:41.090
I think I must be losing my mind.

26:41.200 --> 26:42.200
Losing your mind?

26:46.680 --> 26:48.110
Originally, when you asked Madam He

26:48.110 --> 26:49.550
to come propose marriage,

26:49.550 --> 26:51.000
I was truly very happy.

26:51.750 --> 26:53.380
But then, somehow,

26:53.640 --> 26:54.480
I began to feel

26:54.920 --> 26:56.030
a bit worried.

26:56.550 --> 26:58.150
It all feels a little unreal.

26:58.970 --> 27:00.010
I'm scared.

27:00.480 --> 27:02.070
Was I too impulsive?

27:02.830 --> 27:03.790
Could it be

27:03.920 --> 27:05.770
that I made the wrong decision?

27:06.640 --> 27:07.790
The wrong decision?

27:09.200 --> 27:10.610
Let me finish.

27:13.200 --> 27:14.000
At first,

27:14.310 --> 27:16.310
I felt a bit uncertain and insecure.

27:17.720 --> 27:18.680
But

27:19.720 --> 27:21.980
when I saw you walking toward me just now,

27:23.110 --> 27:24.160
for some reason,

27:24.590 --> 27:26.070
I suddenly felt

27:26.550 --> 27:27.510
that perhaps...

27:29.790 --> 27:31.030
I could try

27:31.270 --> 27:32.200
taking a chance.

27:37.510 --> 27:38.910
You gave me such a fright.

27:39.310 --> 27:39.960
I thought...

27:39.960 --> 27:41.890
You thought I was going to back out?

27:45.200 --> 27:45.880
Really?

27:46.310 --> 27:47.480
So, Lord Chen, even you

27:47.480 --> 27:48.740
would feel insecure?

27:49.510 --> 27:50.310
That's right.

27:51.240 --> 27:52.710
This is my weakness.

27:53.200 --> 27:54.660
So you must keep it a secret

27:54.880 --> 27:56.680
and not let anyone else find out.

27:57.720 --> 27:58.480
Weakness?

27:58.920 --> 27:59.680
Me?

28:10.550 --> 28:11.070
Yes.

28:11.610 --> 28:12.350
You.

28:29.830 --> 28:31.030
Chen Yanyun,

28:32.030 --> 28:33.110
I like you.

28:34.660 --> 28:37.070
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

28:37.520 --> 28:39.370
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

28:40.280 --> 28:43.940
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

28:44.750 --> 28:47.080
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

28:48.220 --> 28:51.920
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

28:52.700 --> 28:54.870
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

28:55.810 --> 28:57.290
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

28:58.380 --> 29:02.960
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

29:04.250 --> 29:07.800
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

29:07.350 --> 29:09.490
This is my favorite hairpin.

29:09.640 --> 29:11.100
Grandmother gave it to me.

29:12.960 --> 29:14.310
I'm giving it to you

29:14.830 --> 29:15.630
as an apology.

29:19.070 --> 29:21.130
Since it was a gift from Grandmother,

29:21.310 --> 29:22.590
you should keep it.

29:24.690 --> 29:26.750
I've already lowered myself enough.

29:26.830 --> 29:28.200
What's with your attitude now?

29:28.200 --> 29:29.350
Still putting on airs?

29:29.350 --> 29:30.280
You're truly...

29:32.790 --> 29:33.440
Forget it.

29:33.680 --> 29:34.270
Anyway, I'm leaving

29:34.270 --> 29:35.480
this hairpin here for you.

29:35.480 --> 29:36.540
Wear it if you want.

29:37.030 --> 29:37.920
If not,

29:38.640 --> 29:39.840
you may throw it away.

29:40.550 --> 29:42.210
Either way, I've apologized.

29:42.590 --> 29:44.030
Xiuju, let's go.

29:47.410 --> 29:48.260
Lian!

29:51.880 --> 29:52.510
What?

29:58.030 --> 29:59.050
I heard

29:59.310 --> 30:00.310
that Yao Wenxiu

30:00.640 --> 30:01.640
is not a good man.

30:02.510 --> 30:04.070
Even though the engagement is set,

30:04.070 --> 30:06.270
you should still look into him further.

30:06.270 --> 30:08.130
What do you mean by that?

30:08.310 --> 30:09.440
Wenxiu and I

30:09.440 --> 30:10.680
have known each other since childhood.

30:10.680 --> 30:11.440
How could I not know

30:11.440 --> 30:12.840
what kind of person he is?

30:19.480 --> 30:20.590
I see now.

30:21.590 --> 30:24.050
Zhao is going to marry Chen Yanyun,

30:24.480 --> 30:26.810
and I am going to marry Wenxiu.

30:27.000 --> 30:28.590
You're the only one left,

30:28.590 --> 30:29.920
without any prospects.

30:29.920 --> 30:31.320
You're jealous,

30:31.350 --> 30:32.620
so you're deliberately trying to upset me.

30:32.620 --> 30:33.420
Isn't that it?

30:35.480 --> 30:36.940
I've said all I have to say.

30:37.440 --> 30:39.370
Believe it or not, that's up to you.

30:40.880 --> 30:41.940
Instead of sticking your nose

30:41.940 --> 30:42.920
where it doesn't belong,

30:42.920 --> 30:44.880
you'd better worry about yourself.

30:44.880 --> 30:45.820
Otherwise, you might end up

30:45.820 --> 30:47.440
marrying some penniless nobody.

30:47.440 --> 30:49.310
By then, how could Lord Chen and Wenxiu

30:49.310 --> 30:51.710
possibly be brothers-in-law to such a man?

31:02.270 --> 31:04.210
Second Miss speaks so harshly.

31:04.510 --> 31:05.440
She took your good intentions

31:05.440 --> 31:06.640
for ill intent.

31:09.270 --> 31:10.310
Let her be.

31:12.830 --> 31:14.030
I have said my piece.

31:15.830 --> 31:17.720
As her sister, I have done my part.

31:20.100 --> 31:22.480
[Ji Mansion]

31:21.430 --> 31:22.240
Look at

31:22.240 --> 31:24.010
this heartless girl.

31:24.070 --> 31:25.590
Third Master Chen came to propose,

31:25.590 --> 31:28.920
but she'd never even written a letter
to tell me beforehand.

31:29.010 --> 31:30.080
Grandmother!

31:30.450 --> 31:33.590
[Bound by Honesty]

31:34.490 --> 31:36.670
Oh, my dear Zhao.

31:40.970 --> 31:42.700
Come on, let me take a good look.

31:48.040 --> 31:49.350
Grandmother.

31:53.770 --> 31:55.940
My precious.

31:57.390 --> 31:59.720
He said he'd ask Grand Secretary He's wife

31:59.880 --> 32:01.210
to act as the matchmaker

32:01.510 --> 32:02.310
and

32:02.790 --> 32:04.760
have the Senior Grand Secretary

32:04.880 --> 32:06.280
officiate your wedding.

32:07.350 --> 32:08.640
I didn't expect him

32:08.750 --> 32:10.610
to value this marriage so highly.

32:11.440 --> 32:13.940
Third Master Chen is honoring you
in this way

32:14.550 --> 32:16.480
because you deserve nothing less.

32:18.270 --> 32:19.900
Our Zhao

32:20.000 --> 32:22.350
is the finest young lady in the world.

32:23.420 --> 32:24.730
Just let him.

32:27.310 --> 32:28.390
That day,

32:28.510 --> 32:30.510
Third Master Chen
suddenly came to propose,

32:29.050 --> 32:37.550
[In Full Radiant and Flourishing]

32:30.790 --> 32:32.790
which gave your uncle, aunt,

32:32.920 --> 32:34.790
Yao, and me quite a shock.

32:35.590 --> 32:37.720
Your uncle and aunt aside,

32:38.000 --> 32:39.110
Yao and I

32:39.350 --> 32:41.880
actually disapproved deep down.

32:43.440 --> 32:45.200
The gap in status is too wide.

32:46.160 --> 32:47.240
Moreover,

32:47.720 --> 32:48.690
our Ji family

32:48.750 --> 32:51.410
still bears the name of
his household servants.

32:52.550 --> 32:55.750
The Chen family has produced officials
for generations.

32:56.000 --> 32:57.530
They're highly prominent.

32:58.880 --> 33:00.440
I was afraid that after you married,

33:00.440 --> 33:02.190
you might be bullied.

33:04.590 --> 33:06.530
Even knowing you're not worried,

33:06.830 --> 33:08.630
there are some hardships in life

33:08.720 --> 33:10.650
that are best avoided if possible.

33:10.920 --> 33:12.440
No need to invite trouble.

33:14.000 --> 33:15.460
But who would have thought

33:15.590 --> 33:18.720
he would bring
a letter of amicable separation with him?

33:18.920 --> 33:20.550
Well, who in this world brings

33:20.550 --> 33:22.300
a letter of amicable separation along

33:22.300 --> 33:23.440
when proposing?

33:24.240 --> 33:25.650
It left Yao and me

33:25.750 --> 33:27.720
at a loss for words.

33:33.850 --> 33:42.670
[Ji Mansion]

33:42.790 --> 33:45.980
[Glowing Bloom]

33:43.440 --> 33:44.680
You've made up your mind?

33:44.680 --> 33:47.080
You really want to
marry Third Master Chen?

33:47.240 --> 33:48.790
I've already said yes.

33:48.880 --> 33:49.800
So what?

33:50.350 --> 33:51.310
If you feel forced

33:51.310 --> 33:52.440
and want to back out,

33:52.590 --> 33:53.240
I can help you

33:53.240 --> 33:54.700
call off this engagement.

33:56.200 --> 33:57.200
Aren't you afraid

33:57.290 --> 33:58.440
of offending Third Master Chen?

33:58.440 --> 33:59.640
What's there to fear?

33:59.960 --> 34:02.060
The worst that can happen is
we lose the business.

34:02.060 --> 34:03.630
He is our family's patron

34:03.750 --> 34:05.010
and a Grand Secretary.

34:05.440 --> 34:06.760
If you offend him,

34:06.790 --> 34:08.960
you might lose
more than just the business.

34:08.960 --> 34:09.670
You might

34:09.800 --> 34:10.929
even lose your life.

34:10.960 --> 34:11.440
You...

34:12.810 --> 34:13.730
Gu Jinzhao!

34:13.840 --> 34:14.440
What?

34:19.100 --> 34:21.510
This is the most important decision
of your life.

34:21.510 --> 34:22.860
I'm worried about you.

34:23.960 --> 34:24.570
Forget it.

34:24.800 --> 34:25.550
Yao.

34:27.320 --> 34:28.650
Don't be upset anymore.

34:29.000 --> 34:30.429
I spoke poorly.

34:31.110 --> 34:32.320
I shouldn't have said those things.

34:32.320 --> 34:33.580
I won't say them again.

34:35.880 --> 34:37.610
Then I'll ask you one more time.

34:37.880 --> 34:38.880
What exactly are you thinking?

34:38.880 --> 34:40.610
Do you really want to marry him?

34:41.230 --> 34:41.880
Yes.

34:42.550 --> 34:44.080
You've thought it through?

34:46.000 --> 34:46.550
Yes.

34:47.150 --> 34:48.440
You love him that much?

34:50.590 --> 34:51.110
Yes.

34:51.320 --> 34:52.230
You really are...

34:52.230 --> 34:53.030
Grandmother!

34:54.360 --> 34:55.940
Yao

34:56.000 --> 34:57.800
just can't bear to part with you.

35:00.320 --> 35:01.360
"A grown daughter cannot
stay home forever"—

35:01.360 --> 35:04.090
that saying was meant for
girls exactly like you.

35:05.320 --> 35:06.790
Even after I marry,

35:07.000 --> 35:08.480
I'll still come back often to visit you

35:08.480 --> 35:09.640
and Grandmother.

35:11.880 --> 35:13.760
I've also read
that letter of amicable separation.

35:13.760 --> 35:15.550
It appears to give you a way out,

35:16.360 --> 35:17.440
but I know

35:18.000 --> 35:19.030
if one day

35:19.150 --> 35:20.670
something were to happen
to Third Master Chen,

35:20.670 --> 35:21.920
with your temperament,

35:21.920 --> 35:24.050
you definitely wouldn't abandon him.

35:24.070 --> 35:25.860
If I couldn't bear to leave him,

35:26.070 --> 35:27.470
wouldn't that only prove

35:27.630 --> 35:29.160
that I've met the right man?

35:32.450 --> 35:33.690
Grandmother.

35:34.710 --> 35:35.590
Yao.

35:36.760 --> 35:38.360
You two are my closest family

35:38.440 --> 35:39.360
in this world.

35:40.280 --> 35:42.410
I don't want to hide anything from you.

35:42.630 --> 35:43.190
Yes,

35:43.670 --> 35:45.210
I'd already made up my mind

35:45.320 --> 35:46.580
and would never marry.

35:47.440 --> 35:48.190
But

35:49.390 --> 35:50.590
the moment Third Master Chen

35:50.590 --> 35:52.190
told me he wanted to marry me,

35:53.190 --> 35:54.650
my heart

35:54.680 --> 35:55.610
began to change.

35:58.800 --> 36:00.150
Just like Yao said,

36:00.800 --> 36:01.960
if one day

36:02.510 --> 36:04.440
something really happened to him,

36:04.630 --> 36:05.920
I'm really not sure

36:05.920 --> 36:07.920
that I'd have the heart to leave him.

36:08.110 --> 36:09.690
But right now, there is one thing

36:09.690 --> 36:10.760
I am sure of,

36:11.440 --> 36:12.920
and that is, even if that day truly came,

36:12.920 --> 36:14.070
I would still be able to

36:14.070 --> 36:15.070
live my life well.

36:18.230 --> 36:19.480
As for right now...

36:21.760 --> 36:23.560
I'm willing to take that chance.

36:27.510 --> 36:29.150
Since you've said as much,

36:29.800 --> 36:31.220
Yao and I

36:31.320 --> 36:32.720
can set our minds at ease.

36:38.710 --> 36:40.020
This bracelet

36:40.360 --> 36:42.770
was a gift from your grandfather

36:42.840 --> 36:46.420
when he first came to
ask for my hand in marriage.

36:46.590 --> 36:48.610
It's been with me for decades.

36:49.150 --> 36:50.480
I'm giving it to you.

36:51.590 --> 36:52.800
Wear it,

36:54.310 --> 36:55.450
so it may

36:56.360 --> 36:57.920
remind you on my behalf:

36:58.360 --> 37:00.110
if you ever encounter hardship,

37:00.110 --> 37:01.480
come back to Tongzhou.

37:02.440 --> 37:04.100
This will always be your home.

37:06.670 --> 37:07.320
Okay.

37:16.630 --> 37:17.890
Take care of yourself.

37:19.590 --> 37:22.370
[Great Yan Bank
General Circulation Banknotes]

37:22.710 --> 37:24.170
Here's half of your dowry.

37:25.480 --> 37:26.680
This many banknotes?

37:34.620 --> 37:36.980
[Glowing Bloom]

37:51.800 --> 37:53.000
My Lady, you're back.

37:53.510 --> 37:55.320
Were there any letters for me
these past few days?

37:55.320 --> 37:55.960
No.

37:56.190 --> 37:58.030
Earlier, Old Madam's servant came by

37:58.030 --> 38:00.690
to say that she wishes to see you
when you return.

38:00.960 --> 38:01.630
Got it.

38:06.590 --> 38:08.720
Why hasn't Ye Xian left the palace yet?

38:08.960 --> 38:09.630
I'll head out later

38:09.630 --> 38:10.890
and ask Guard Li again.

38:11.480 --> 38:12.030
Okay.

38:13.460 --> 38:18.600
[Crystal-Clear at Heart]

38:24.000 --> 38:25.710
Zhao, come here.

38:34.800 --> 38:35.440
This

38:36.030 --> 38:36.880
is the dowry list

38:36.880 --> 38:38.670
your mother left behind.

38:41.530 --> 38:46.170
[Ji Family Dowry Register]

38:44.280 --> 38:45.190
At that time,

38:45.320 --> 38:46.110
your fourth branch

38:46.110 --> 38:48.040
had just split from the main family

38:48.440 --> 38:49.920
and rented a
modest three-courtyard residence.

38:49.920 --> 38:51.150
It was too small

38:50.520 --> 38:53.290
[Fine White Jade Bracelet]
[Huanghuali Desk]

38:51.480 --> 38:53.320
to store all these things.

38:53.290 --> 38:56.060
[Song Edition
of The Collected Works of Tao Yuanming]

38:54.440 --> 38:56.570
So they've been kept in my storehouse,

38:57.550 --> 38:59.510
under my care.

39:00.110 --> 39:01.970
Now that you're getting married,

39:02.320 --> 39:03.450
your mother's dowry

39:03.840 --> 39:05.500
should naturally be returned

39:05.630 --> 39:06.550
to you in full.

39:10.800 --> 39:11.480
No!

39:28.030 --> 39:28.760
All right.

39:29.230 --> 39:30.440
I'm a bit tired.

39:31.230 --> 39:33.030
You all may return to your rooms.

39:40.920 --> 39:41.630
Zhao.

39:46.320 --> 39:47.190
Keep it safe.

39:50.440 --> 39:51.840
Thank you, Grandmother.

40:03.110 --> 40:03.710
What?

40:03.750 --> 40:04.800
Seeing me hand

40:04.800 --> 40:06.110
all those properties over to Zhao

40:06.110 --> 40:07.310
made your heart ache?

40:07.760 --> 40:08.720
I originally thought

40:08.720 --> 40:10.720
you'd return at most half of them.

40:11.110 --> 40:11.840
I didn't expect

40:11.840 --> 40:13.370
you to return them all to her.

40:13.370 --> 40:14.230
Those properties

40:14.230 --> 40:16.760
belonged to Dezhao's wife
in the first place.

40:16.920 --> 40:18.580
If I insisted on keeping them,

40:18.760 --> 40:20.590
would they not come
demanding them eventually?

40:20.590 --> 40:22.030
Better for me to return them openly

40:22.030 --> 40:23.290
and generously to her.

40:23.760 --> 40:25.840
That way, everyone gets to save face.

40:26.800 --> 40:27.960
If we waited until the day

40:27.960 --> 40:29.560
she came to demand them back,

40:29.670 --> 40:30.600
by then, not even

40:31.070 --> 40:32.130
a word of gratitude

40:32.440 --> 40:33.570
would be left for us.

40:34.030 --> 40:36.410
But what about Lian?

40:36.760 --> 40:38.070
Many of those items were already

40:38.070 --> 40:39.670
included in Lian's dowry list.

40:39.670 --> 40:41.230
If the Yao family were to
make a fuss about it...

40:41.230 --> 40:42.670
If they were to make a fuss about it,

40:42.670 --> 40:43.710
just talk back.

40:44.500 --> 40:45.540
Tell them

40:45.880 --> 40:46.630
those things

40:46.800 --> 40:48.330
have all been given to Zhao.

40:48.710 --> 40:49.710
If they've got the nerve,

40:49.710 --> 40:51.710
they can go ask Chen Yanyun for them.

40:52.810 --> 40:53.700
Seriously.

40:54.090 --> 41:00.300
[Crystal-Clear at Heart]

40:54.360 --> 40:55.630
What are you afraid of?

40:57.440 --> 40:58.820
Don't be fooled by Chen Yanyun's

40:58.820 --> 41:00.380
current idleness at home.

41:00.630 --> 41:01.840
With his abilities,

41:02.190 --> 41:04.360
his reinstatement
is only a matter of time.

41:04.360 --> 41:05.440
In the future, Zhao

41:05.630 --> 41:07.690
will be the wife of a Grand Secretary.

41:09.190 --> 41:11.360
As for you, teach Lian more

41:12.290 --> 41:13.950
so she learns proper manners.

41:14.470 --> 41:16.000
Let her maintain close ties

41:16.360 --> 41:17.800
with her elder sister.

41:18.450 --> 41:19.670
Let's see if the Yao family

41:19.670 --> 41:21.200
dares to mistreat her then.

41:21.550 --> 41:23.880
You're right, Mother.

41:28.030 --> 41:29.190
My Lady, you've always seemed

41:29.190 --> 41:31.190
absent-minded these past few days.

41:31.440 --> 41:32.650
You noticed it too?

41:33.510 --> 41:35.770
I haven't slept properly for two nights.

41:37.190 --> 41:39.030
Well, what if Xian finds out

41:39.030 --> 41:40.530
that Zhao is marrying

41:40.710 --> 41:41.760
the Third Master of the Chen family?

41:41.760 --> 41:43.190
The thought of it makes me anxious too.

41:43.190 --> 41:43.840
But His Lordship

41:43.840 --> 41:45.440
will find out sooner or later.

41:45.440 --> 41:46.100
Yes,

41:46.440 --> 41:48.170
he'll find out sooner or later.

41:48.190 --> 41:49.510
But with his temper,

41:49.840 --> 41:50.480
there's no telling

41:50.480 --> 41:51.590
what he might do.

41:51.960 --> 41:52.670
Fifth Aunt!

41:54.070 --> 41:54.880
Zhao.

41:56.840 --> 41:57.550
Fifth Aunt,

41:57.840 --> 41:59.110
are you free right now?

41:59.590 --> 42:00.670
I have something to say to you.

42:00.670 --> 42:01.280
I'm free.

42:01.510 --> 42:03.510
I also wished to have a talk with you.

42:03.960 --> 42:04.490
Let's go.

42:06.670 --> 42:14.800
[The Penal Court]

42:15.000 --> 42:15.510
My Lord.

42:16.230 --> 42:18.590
Miss Gu has been looking for you
these past few days.

42:18.590 --> 42:19.880
She asked if you would be free tomorrow

42:19.880 --> 42:21.540
and said she wanted to see you.

42:33.710 --> 42:37.350
[A Splendid Match]
